### Summary of Changes

1. **Replaced `getRipgrepPath()` with an Exported `resolveRipgrepPath()`** in [ripGrep.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/test_large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_26777/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/tools/ripGrep.ts):
